refused: d235_uses_what_isnt_listed.cy:20:12, line 20 column 12
20 |     return $a < $b;
   |            ^^^^^^^
 what: `?item` needs `any.type`, which doesn't list `op <`
 why:  a generic body may use on a `?item` only what its requirement lists, and only an interface gives operations (D235, D240)
